codex
The limits are now clear: a submitted word can reach ARM decoding, but unsupported instructions do not all produce a guest exception. The general failure path stops the virtual CPU and returns control to the debugger; some coprocessor paths still exit the host process. The `#312` branch specifically routes its undefined-instruction class through the conditional guest exception handler.

`_scratchpad/gxprobe.py` falls outside the requested reading scope. The ARM probes I inspected contain their own pty harnesses, so their capability does not depend on that helper.
